ES:
¡Eo, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}! ¿Estás vagueando
en casa? ¡Déjame vaguear contigo,
que me encanta!{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Estás ahí? ¡Mira que
voy a pegar la oreja a la puerta
por si escucho algún ruido!{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

FR:
Il n'y a personne ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Hmm... Je ferais
mieux de rentrer à la maison dans
ce cas, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}¡Aaah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Tienes cucarachas!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0013:}}Que yo
soy el tío más pasota para limpiar,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
pero esto ya es demasiado.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Adiós!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I hope you don't mind me popping
in like this!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}I was getting tired of walking,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
and I realized I was right in front
of your house, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}I thought I should at least say hello,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Böyle çat kapı gelmeme kızmazsın
umarım!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Yürümekten yorulmuştum,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
bir baktım evinin önündeyim,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Hiç değilse bir selam vereyim dedim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Whenever someone visits me,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I
totally have to make a mad dash to
clean up my place.
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}If someone dropped in unannounced
like I did,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'd get super panicked,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bana biri geleceği zaman{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} evi
yetiştirmek için deli gibi koştururum.
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Benim yaptığım gibi biri haber
vermeden gelseydi,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} fena paniklerdim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}To make up for just dropping in on
you like this,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I brought you {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} as a gift!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Böyle çat kapı geldiğim için gönlünü
alayım diye{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} sana {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} getirdim!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tengo una cosa muy rica para ti.
¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ya verás como te encanta.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ho qui un regalino per te!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}È {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Scommetto che ti piacerà un sacco!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Grazie dell'ospitalità!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Beh, è meglio che vada adesso,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Ricorda che la porta di casa mia
è sempre aperta per te!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Vieni a trovarmi quando vuoi!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Beni ağırladığın için sağ ol.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ben artık eve döneyim,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.
Hem unutma,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}kapım sana her zaman
açık,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} bir ara sen de uğra,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Vas a salir, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Entonces me largo yo también,
que aquí solo no pinto nada.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Gracias por dejarme pasar las
horas muertas en tu casa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ma devi uscire? {{TAG:0003:000D:}}Aspetta!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Esco anch'io insieme a te!
Non voglio rimanere qui da solo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Grazie dell'ospitalità e scusa
se ti ho fatto questa improvvisata,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Huch!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Gehst du etwa weg?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Halt, dann geh ich auch!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Nicht, dass du mich hier einsperrst!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Danke für deine Gastfreundschaft,
obwohl mein Besuch sicher etwas
überraschend kam,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
